linden-algorithm provides CMake targets:

    find_package(linden_algorithm CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE linden::linden_algorithm)

    # 子模块目标（按需单独链接）:
    #   linden::scanner  —— 条码/二维码扫描
    #   linden::thread   —— ThreadPool / ObjectPool / Team

Note: linden-algorithm requires zbar as a system dependency:
    sudo apt-get install libzbar-dev

To enable CUDA acceleration for the point_cloud module:
    vcpkg install linden-algorithm[cuda]:x64-linux
